# VIctory — GTA VI Windows Compatibility Layer (RTX 5060 / 8 GB Edition)

> Experimental Xbox Series S/X compatibility runtime for running GTA VI on Windows D3D12 hardware, tuned for **8 GB VRAM / 16 GB System RAM** laptops (tested on RTX 5060 Laptop + Windows 11 x64).

---

